    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2D7REnceExJFRb9YTXcQuYY)_\n\n## What\n\n- New `sp-collec-query-linkify` (core): Org links in cell text show as their description in `org-link` face; RET or click follows them. Does nothing if `org-link-descriptive` is nil.\n- vui and exc renderers use it. A cell holding a link is read-only (vui shows text instead of a field; exc refuses the edit) so an edit can't overwrite the link with its description.\n- `sp-collec-query-link-titles` docstring now says what it does: only the title column, only in the dynamic block and Org buffer.\n- Literate doc and CHANGELOG updated.\n\n## Not tested\nNo Emacs in the container. Unknown whether exc/ETAF keeps the face and keymap text properties (the description shows either way).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9gkk4txLtDmo4J8iv)_",
